4) Phase Shield:  The Phase Shield
is the only special weapon displayed
in the upper left corner.  It uses the
same meter as the regular shields, but
located on the opposite side of the
screen.  Unlike normal shields, they
do not recharge, but you can carry
multiple layers of Phase Shields.

